# devel/grok-build (WIP)

Pinned source intent: grok-build `dc69e03` (freebsd-port-plan).

## Local build (no distfile yet)

```sh
cd /path/to/cloudbsd-ports  # this worktree
make -C devel/grok-build GROK_SRC=$HOME/git/grok-build package
```

Or from a checked-out grok tree on FreeBSD:

```sh
export PROTOC=$(command -v protoc)
cargo build -p xai-grok-pager-bin --release
install -m 755 target/release/xai-grok-pager /usr/local/bin/grok
```

